-`VF_REQUIRE_APP_RESTART` - set it in the project's `system.cfg` or `game.cfg` and restart the
-editor; it cannot be toggled live). Density comes from the Time of Day's volumetric fog `Global
-density` - the table in `SceneReferredCalibration.md` section 3.1 turns it into a visibility, and
-0.1 (haze, 3.9 km) to 0.4 (mist, 1 km) is where shafts read clearly. The two cvars above are
-already at their ReCS defaults. `e_VolumetricFog` itself is not changed by ReCS: it needs a restart,
-it changes which fog system every level's authoring is read through, and it is the user's call per
